soul for a form of everlasting life.  The cost has left his flesh rotting away
as he continues to live.  Without his soul he can make no conscious decisions
of his own, bowing to his hidden masters will.  His one wish, were any to learn
it, is to end his servitude and enter the warm embrace of death.    
~
