   Aaldimar Crawlinor has never had a problem with job satisfaction.  Anything
that could possible cause another living being pain is his joy, from maiming to
burning to crippling.  His one greatest dream is to one day have Erlu himself
to torture, though he has been wise enough to keep it to himself.  A whistled
tune is often the last thing his victims hear, at least when it isn't the sound
of their own screaming.    
